Apply the hardcoded backend policy before reading the configuration.

An incomplete configuration can fail before readconf_defaults applies
HSYSBIN, leaving all compression backends in application-relative mode.
Initialize the policy and its controls together with the other defaults.
HSYSBIN=0 retains the upstream configurable default.

--- a/dev/peach.pas
+++ b/dev/peach.pas
@@ -23461,7 +23461,13 @@
 forceconvert:=0;
 nativedrag:=1;
 autosync:=1;
-sys7zlin:=0;
+sys7zlin:=HSYSBIN;
+if HSYSBIN>0 then
+   begin
+   FormPeach.LabelSysBin.enabled:=false;
+   FormPeach.ComboBoxSysbin.enabled:=false;
+   FormPeach.ComboBoxSysbin.ItemIndex:=HSYSBIN;
+   end;
 ignorepathdd:=0;
 level_brotli:=3;
 level_rar:=3;
